    "name": "detecting-attacks-on-historian-servers",
    "description": "Detect cyber attacks on OT historian servers (OSIsoft PI, Ignition, GE Proficy, Wonderware InSQL) using a Python detector that flags unauthorized queries, data manipulation, and lateral-movement indicators as historians pivot between IT and OT networks. Use when monitoring historians bridging IT/OT zones for compromise, investigating historian-specific CVE exploitation, or validating historian data integrity after a suspected OT incident.",
